  "text": "Every wedding venue starts the same way. A few enquiries, a few spreadsheets, a shared inbox. Then the business grows. Email here, WhatsApp there, Facebook on someone's phone, Instagram on someone else's, notes in a spreadsheet, bookings in a diary. And before long nobody knows where everything lives. Care brings it all together. One system, one team, one source of truth. For the first time, you can see exactly what's happening across the entire venue. Live dashboards, showing lead sources, conversion rates, tour bookings, marketing performance, revenue pipelines. No manual reports, no spreadsheet gymnastics, just the numbers that matter, updated automatically. Then there's communication, every conversation, every enquiry, every message, in one timeline. Email, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, phone call transcripts, website chatbot conversations. Everything stored against the couple's record. No more hunting through six different inboxes trying to find what somebody said three weeks ago. Every member of your team works from exactly the same information. Your wedding coordinators, sales team, owners, event managers. Everyone sees the same conversations, the same notes, the same history. No private inboxes. No duplicated records. No losing years of knowledge when a team member leaves. No leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leaving, no leavin